<title>UK: Badenwerk sets 100 mln Sfr FRN due 2005.</title>
<headline>Badenwerk sets 100 mln Sfr FRN due 2005.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, Zurich and Hypobank (Switzerland).</p>
<p> BORROWER   BADENWERK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN CHF   BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    11.APR.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    11.APR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  99.20     PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> LISTING    SWISS     DENOMS (K) 10-1M     SALE LIMITS US/DE</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SWISS     HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE IS A REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
